WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.063
Sara frowned.

2
00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:15.441
"Tor gets grumpy sometimes too.

3
00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:19.961
And flying away was mean!"

4
00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:22.077
Rex nodded.

5
00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:25.555
"She only likes dinos who fly!"

6
00:00:25.556 --> 00:00:31.125
"Yeah!" Sid said.

7
00:00:31.126 --> 00:00:34.842
Just then Tor flew over.

8
00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:42.211
Another dinosaur was with her.

9
00:00:42.212 --> 00:00:45.719
"This is Don," Tor said.

10
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:49.131
"Hi," Don said.

11
00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:53.501
The buddies looked away.

12
00:00:53.502 --> 00:00:57.646
"What's wrong?" Tor asked.

13
00:00:57.647 --> 00:01:02.195
"You're not our friend, Tor," Rex said.

14
00:01:02.196 --> 00:01:06.782
Tor gasped. "What?"

15
00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:09.339
"Yeah!" Sid said.

16
00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:14.533
"Go fly with your friend!" Sara said.

17
00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:18.594
"You're my friends too," Tor said.

18
00:01:18.595 --> 00:01:20.118
"Look!

19
00:01:20.119 --> 00:01:23.554
Don helped me find something."

20
00:01:23.555 --> 00:01:26.527
Tor opened her bag.

21
00:01:26.528 --> 00:01:32.251
Apples rolled out!

22
00:01:32.252 --> 00:01:37.632
Rex, Sid, and Sara gasped.

23
00:01:37.633 --> 00:01:42.057
"Sorry, Tor!" they said.

24
00:01:42.058 --> 00:01:49.844
Tor smiled. "That's okay."

25
00:01:49.845 --> 00:01:53.536
The buddies set up their party.

26
00:01:53.537 --> 00:01:59.345
They had good food.

27
00:01:59.346 --> 00:02:05.444
They had a new friend.

28
00:02:05.445 --> 00:02:11.204
And everyone had fun!

